    "Generations UnitedExternal Link",
    "Juvenile Sex Trafficking (JuST)External Link",
    "National Council of Juvenile and Family Court Judges (NCJFCJ)External Link",
    "National Child Traumatic Stress Network (NCTSN)External Link",
    "National Foster Parent Association (NFPA)External Link",
    "National Center on the Sexual Behavior of Youth (NCSBY)External Link",
    "Families Rising (formerly NACAC)External Link",
    "By prioritizing deep, community‑rooted partnerships, our Washington health plan Coordinated Care works with organizations to meet local needs and improve outcomes for those touched by foster care.",
    "Meet Linda, a Superior HealthPlan member, who is a foster parent of four children with complex healthcare needs. Watch how a strong partnership between a managed care organization and a provider has made a tremendous difference in this family.",
    "ATTACh is a national organization addressing attachment issues in traumatized children. Centene sponsors a virtual peer-led support group for foster and adoptive caregivers that members from all of our health plans can participate in.",
    "“I’m a parent and a professional therapist. I’ve taken lots of training and been in lots of support groups, and this one is by far the best I have ever experienced. The only one that combines all three elements of sound science, practical application, and support from others with lived experience.”",
    "-Support Group Participant, 2023",
    "Transforming the health of the communities we serve, one person at a time.",
